(footprint "DT15-6P"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "TE Connectivity DEUTSCH DT15-6P, sealed PCB header receptacle, 6 positions, STRAIGHT (180deg) pins, FLANGED panel mount, PCB parallel to the panel; DEUTSCH size 16 contacts, 13 A on 14-16 AWG, 250 V, -55..+125 degC, 100 mating cycles (108-151009); mates DT06-6S-XXXX. Geometry from TE customer drawing C-DT15-6P rev D (25SEP2019), application spec 114-151046 rev A fig. DT15-6P, cross-checked on TE STEP c-dt15-6p-99-3d (pin tails on hole centres, 0.000 mm). PCB layout: 6x D1.88 +/-0.05, pins 4.445 pitch in two columns 9.119 apart; 4x NPTH D3.43 +0.12/-0 for #4-20 Plastite 48 screws from under the PCB (21.336 x 21.742). Pin block is offset 1.537 mm from the panel cutout centre, away from the key. Seating plane on the PCB; flange underside 4.19, flange front (panel seat) 15.24-15.75 above the PCB (drawing 15.75), nose top 30.35; pins 3.10 below. Panel cutout option 2 on Dwgs.User: 25.17 (screw axis) x 21.84, 4x R6.35, 2x D3.94 on 32.89 for #6-19 screws, panel 6.25 max. CAVEAT: the 114-151046 layout figure is a bottom view; this footprint follows the drawing front and rear views and the STEP: seen from the component side, key down, left column 1-2-3 from bottom to top, right column 4-5-6 from top to bottom. If the fab NPTH tolerance is symmetric, order 3.45-3.50. Origin: centre of the 4 PCB screw holes (= centre of the pin field); the panel cutout centre is 1.537 mm from it towards the key. https://www.te.com/en/product-DT15-6P.html")
	(tags "connector DEUTSCH DT DT15 6 pin position straight vertical 180deg flange panel mount sealed automotive TE size 16 13A header receptacle")
